  "description": {
    "zh": "把每个会话整理成可导航的主题列表，两种入口：右侧常驻胶囊刻度条（悬停展开、点击跳转、一键回到最新），或侧栏主题面板（搜索、跨会话检索、重新总结）。两个入口都能在「设置 → 会话主题」独立开关。",
    "en": "Turns every DSH conversation into a navigable topic list with two entry points: an always-on capsule rail on the right edge (hover to expand, click to jump, back to latest) and a searchable sidebar panel. Both toggle independently under Settings → Session topics."
  },
